OLUTION EST ADOPTEE A L'UNANIMITE"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[672.0, 5549.0], [2522.0, 5534.0], [2523.0, 5682.0], [673.0, 5697.0]], "score": 0.9991072416305542, "text": "QUATRIEME RESOLUTION"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[672.0, 5825.0], [5947.0, 5825.0], [5947.0, 5982.0], [672.0, 5982.0]], "score": 0.9902642965316772, "text": "L'assemblée générale donne également quitus de l'exécution de son mandat pendant le même"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[672.0, 5972.0], [2918.0, 5962.0], [2919.0, 6110.0], [673.0, 6120.0]], "score": 0.9894082546234131, "text": "exercice, au Commissaire aux Comptes."}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[682.0, 6253.0], [5145.0, 6253.0], [5145.0, 6395.0], [682.0, 6395.0]], "score": 0.9892235398292542, "text": "MISE AUX VOIX, CETTE RESOLUTION EST ADOPTEE A L'UNANIMITE"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[677.0, 6676.0], [2493.0, 6661.0], [2494.0, 6809.0], [678.0, 6824.0]], "score": 0.9993225932121277, "text": "CINQUIEME RESOLUTION"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[682.0, 6956.0], [5951.0, 6956.0], [5951.0, 7099.0], [682.0, 7099.0]], "score": 0.9947162866592407, "text": "L'Assemblée Générale, constate que les comptes annuels font apparaître un bénéfice net"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[677.0, 7099.0], [3128.0, 7089.0], [3128.0, 7232.0], [678.0, 7242.0]], "score": 0.998514711856842, "text": "comptable d'un montant de 388.447 Francs."}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[677.0, 7365.0], [5965.0, 7346.0], [5966.0, 7508.0], [678.0, 7527.0]], "score": 0.9908734560012817, "text": "Adoptant la proposition du Conseil d'Administration, elle décide d'affecter le résultat de la"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[682.0, 7523.0], [1730.0, 7512.0], [1731.0, 7645.0], [683.0, 7656.0]], "score": 0.9917080402374268, "text": "manière suivante :"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[686.0, 7798.0], [2364.0, 7783.0], [2366.0, 7931.0], [688.0, 7946.0]], "score": 0.9742765426635742, "text": "- au compte report à nouveau"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[4713.0, 7926.0], [5675.0, 7936.0], [5674.0, 8069.0], [4711.0, 8059.0]], "score": 0.9627347588539124, "text": ".. 388.447 Francs"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[748.0, 7936.0], [2894.0, 7926.0], [2895.0, 8069.0], [749.0, 8079.0]], "score": 0.9828568696975708, "text": "en atténuation des pertes antérieures .."}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[696.0, 8212.0], [5961.0, 8212.0], [5961.0, 8354.0], [696.0, 8354.0]], "score": 0.9911442995071411, "text": "Conformément aux dispositions de l'article 243 bis du C.G.I., nous vous rappelons qu'il n'a été"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[701.0, 8354.0], [4206.0, 8354.0], [4206.0, 8483.0], [701.0, 8483.0]], "score": 0.9956362843513489, "text": "distribué aucun dividende au cours des trois derniers exercices."}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[696.0, 8625.0], [5169.0, 8625.0], [5169.0, 8768.0], [696.0, 8768.0]], "score": 0.9916471242904663, "text": "MISE AUX VOIX, CETTE RESOLUTION EST ADOPTEE A L'UNANIMITE"}], "page": 5, "pdf": "63e3428c5e3cba7204159a34__63e3428c5e3cba7204159a34.pdf", "skew_angle": 0.0}